msgstr "强调色"

#: chromaleon.js:205
msgid "Main color"
msgstr "主色"

#: chromaleon.js:233
msgid "Wallpaper Colors"
msgstr "壁纸颜色"

#: chromaleon.js:239
msgid ""
"The system automatically updates the accent color based on your wallpaper."
msgstr "系统将依据壁纸自动更新强调色。"

#: chromaleon.js:297
msgid "Additional colors"
msgstr "更多颜色"

#: chromaleon.js:334
msgid "Add wallpapers"
msgstr "添加壁纸"

#: chromaleon.js:348
msgid "Wallpapers"
msgstr "壁纸列表"

#: chromaleon.js:398
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "颜色"

#: chromaleon.js:403
msgid "GNOME Colors"
msgstr "GNOME 主题色"

#: chromaleon.js:404
msgid "Use native GNOME colors instead of wallpaper colors."
msgstr "使用 GNOME 原生主题色，而非壁纸提取颜色。"

#: chromaleon.js:409
msgid "Prefer Light Style"
msgstr "偏好亮色主题"

#: chromaleon.js:410
msgid "Use a light style for the Shell in the light theme."
msgstr "亮色主题下，为 Shell 采用浅色样式。"

#: chromaleon.js:429
msgid "Tint GNOME"
msgstr "GNOME 色调渲染"

#: chromaleon.js:430
msgid "Based on Tint my GNOME"
msgstr "基于 Tint my GNOME 项目"

#: chromaleon.js:435
msgid "Tint Shell"
msgstr "Shell 色调渲染"

#: chromaleon.js:436
msgid "Tints the GNOME Shell with the color of your choice."
msgstr "使用你选定的颜色渲染 GNOME Shell 界面。"

#: chromaleon.js:442
msgid "Tint Panel"
msgstr "面板着色"

#: chromaleon.js:444
msgid ""
"Keeping this disabled resolves issues with panel modifications in extensions "
"such as \"Blur My Shell\" and \"PaperWM\"."
msgstr ""
"保持该选项为禁用状态，可解决 “Blur My Shell”、“PaperWM” 等扩展在修改面板时出"
"现的各类问题。"

#: chromaleon.js:458
msgid "Tint Apps"
msgstr "应用程序色调渲染"

#: chromaleon.js:460
msgid "Tints the LibAdwaita applications with the color of your choice."
msgstr "使用你选定的颜色渲染 LibAdwaita 应用程序。"

#: chromaleon.js:467
msgid ""
"Also tint the GTK3 apps (the {0} extension and the {1} theme are required to "
"avoid bugs)."
msgstr "同时渲染 GTK3 应用（需安装 {0} 扩展与 {1} 主题以规避故障）。"

#: chromaleon.js:480
msgid "Tint GTK3 Apps"
msgstr "GTK3 应用程序色调渲染"

#: chromaleon.js:494
msgid "Darker Tint"
msgstr "加深渲染色调"

#: chromaleon.js:495
msgid "Applies a darker tint."
msgstr "启用加深色调渲染。"

#: chromaleon.js:535
msgid "Icon Theme"
msgstr "图标主题"

#: chromaleon.js:540
msgid "Folder icon theme"
msgstr "文件夹图标主题"

#: chromaleon.js:541
msgid "Applies the accent color to folder icons."
msgstr "将强调色应用至文件夹图标。"

#: chromaleon.js:547
msgid "Application icon theme"
msgstr "应用程序图标主题"

#: chromaleon.js:548
msgid "Applies the accent color to some app icons."
msgstr "将强调色应用至部分应用程序图标。"

#: chromaleon.js:552
msgid "MoreWaita"
msgstr "MoreWaita"

#: chromaleon.js:553
msgid "Applies integration with the MoreWaita icon pack."
msgstr "开启与 MoreWaita 图标包的适配集成。"

#: chromaleon.js:588
msgid "Customization"
msgstr "自定义"

#: chromaleon.js:593
msgid "Custom stylesheet"
msgstr "自定义样式表"

#: chromaleon.js:595
msgid ""
"A file that overrides the CSS of the shell and user extensions, with support "
"for ChromaLeon accent colors."
msgstr "该文件可覆盖 Shell 和用户扩展的 CSS，并支持 ChromaLeon 强调色变量。"

#: chromaleon.js:614 chromaleon.js:631
msgid "About the custom stylesheet"
msgstr "关于自定义样式表"

#: chromaleon.js:620
msgid "Open file"
msgstr "打开文件"

#: chromaleon.js:633
msgid ""
"This file is used to apply custom CSS to GNOME Shell.\n"
"\n"
"The extension processes all content within this file, replacing the "
"<b><tt>@@ACCENT@@</tt></b> and <b><tt>-st-accent-color</tt></b> variables "
"with the color selected in the ChromaLeon settings before applying them to "
"the system. This can be useful if an extension does not have the accent "
"colors applied correctly.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Tip:</b> If your changes do not take effect, try adding <b><tt>!"
"important</tt></b> to your CSS rules."
msgstr ""
"该文件用于向 GNOME Shell 加载自定义 CSS。\n"
"\n"
"扩展会预处理文件内全部内容：在样式应用至系统前，将变量 <b><tt>@@ACCENT@@</"
"tt></b> 与 <b><tt>-st-accent-color</tt></b> 替换为你在 ChromaLeon 设置中选定"
"的强调色。该功能可修复部分扩展强调色渲染异常的问题。\n"
"\n"
"<b>提示：</b> 若修改未生效，可尝试在 CSS 规则中添加 <b><tt>!important</tt></"
"b>。"

#: chromaleon.js:640
msgid "Close"
msgstr "关闭"

#: chromaleon.js:662
msgid "Failed to open custom.css: "
msgstr "无法打开 custom.css 文件： "

#: chromaleon.js:669
msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "杂项"

#: chromaleon.js:674
msgid "Apply to Flatpaks"
msgstr "应用至 Flatpak 应用"

#: chromaleon.js:676
msgid "Allow Flatpaks to access your custom accent color variables."
msgstr "允许 Flatpak 应用访问自定义强调色变量。"

#: chromaleon.js:682
msgid "Enable shortcut"
msgstr "启用快捷键"

#: chromaleon.js:684
msgid "Create a shortcut in the app grid by adding a .desktop file."
msgstr "通过创建 .desktop 文件，在应用网格生成快捷入口。"

#: chromaleon.js:808
msgid "Wallpaper deleted successfully!"
msgstr "壁纸删除成功！"

#: chromaleon.js:812
msgid "Error deleting wallpaper: "
msgstr "删除壁纸失败： "

#: chromaleon.js:818
msgid "Select a Wallpaper"
msgstr "选择壁纸"

#: chromaleon.js:820
msgid "_Open"
msgstr "打开（_Open）"

#: chromaleon.js:821
msgid "_Cancel"
msgstr "取消（_Cancel）"

#: chromaleon.js:826
msgid "All Images"
msgstr "所有图片"

#: chromaleon.js:853
msgid "Wallpaper already exists!"
msgstr "壁纸已存在！"

#: chromaleon.js:869
msgid "Wallpaper added successfully!"
msgstr "壁纸添加成功！"

#: chromaleon.js:873
msgid "Error copying wallpaper: "
msgstr "复制壁纸失败： "

#: chromaleon.js:1309
msgid "Unable to load colors."
msgstr "加载颜色失败。"

#: chromaleon.js:1590 chromaleon.js:1614
msgid "Support"
msgstr "支持"

#: chromaleon.js:1602
msgid "Support the project"
msgstr "支持本项目"

#: chromaleon.js:1607
msgid "Why support ChromaLeon?"
msgstr "为什么支持 ChromaLeon？"

#: chromaleon.js:1609
msgid ""
"Developing free software requires time, energy, and dedication. Your "
"donation directly supports the project and helps keep it alive!"
msgstr ""
"开发自由软件需要投入大量时间、精力与热忱。您的捐赠将直接支持本项目，助力项目"
"持续维护更新！"

#: chromaleon.js:1613
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"
